        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "OpenAI has upgraded the model powering ChatGPT voice mode with a new generation of voice models named GPT-Live.",
          "zh": "OpenAI 已使用名为 GPT-Live 的新一代语音模型升级了为 ChatGPT 语音模式提供支持的模型。"
