        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "GPT-Live represents a new generation of voice models designed for natural human-AI interaction.",
            "This new model is now integrated into ChatGPT Voice mode, providing its core capabilities.",
            "GPT-Live can delegate complex tasks requiring web search, deeper reasoning, or more complex work to OpenAI's latest frontier model behind the scenes."
